{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23123","headline":"和张十八秘书谢裴相公寄马 · 白居易","name":"和张十八秘书谢裴相公寄马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"齿齐臕足毛头腻，秘阁张郎叱拨驹。\n洗了颔花翻假锦，走时蹄汗蹋真珠。\n青衫乍见曾惊否，红粟难赊得饱无。\n丞相寄来应有意，遣君骑去上云衢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}